{"title":"유레카","artist":"로쿠데나시","sourceId":"reference:fRZuaZfZY0zn4uxcT0RJ","sourceHash":"deccaa0f63be27f339a26eb8de8a72a12bbf0689555eb59d2e7c8a71da75fd68","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":36120753,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.25,"end":7.73,"text":"優しい人のなり方を 誰か教えてほしかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":7.73,"end":15.56,"text":"頼れる人のなり方を 誰か教えてほしかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":31.53,"end":35.38,"text":"雨に濡れて傘も差せずに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":35.38,"end":39.05,"text":"いることもどうでもよくなって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":39.05,"end":42.35,"text":"明るさが急に怖くなって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":42.35,"end":47.27,"text":"大丈夫じゃないよ 大丈夫じゃないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":47.27,"end":50.92,"text":"一緒に歩くの嫌になって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":50.92,"end":54.61,"text":"でもひとりでいたいわけじゃなくて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":54.61,"end":58.61,"text":"目を合わせて笑えなくなって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":58.61,"end":59.44,"text":"大丈夫じゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":59.44,"end":64.76,"text":"それは大丈夫じゃないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":64.76,"end":68.72,"text":"何度 傷つけ 間違って 失敗して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":68.72,"end":73.22,"text":"優しさ蔑ろにしただろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":73.22,"end":76.53,"text":"傷ついて 許して 許されて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":76.53,"end":80.61,"text":"お前は生きろと言われただろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":80.61,"end":82.77,"text":"みんなひとりぼっちだけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":82.77,"end":84.62,"text":"孤独だけじゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":84.62,"end":86.43,"text":"あなただけここにいれば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":86.43,"end":96.03,"text":"孤独じゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":96.03,"end":99.78,"text":"側に誰もいないこと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":99.78,"end":103.75,"text":"寂しいの みんな知ってる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":103.75,"end":107.49000000000001,"text":"誰かの側にいること","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":107.49000000000001,"end":111.94,"text":"なんで こんな下手なんだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":111.94,"end":115.69,"text":"耳を塞ぐの癖になって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":115.69,"end":119.57,"text":"でも心を閉ざすわけじゃなくて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":119.57,"end":123.28,"text":"慣れたフリ続けてるって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":123.28,"end":124.28,"text":"大丈夫じゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":124.28,"end":129.8,"text":"それは大丈夫じゃないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":129.8,"end":133.63,"text":"何度 ぶつかって 離れて 近づいて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":133.63,"end":137.87,"text":"正しい形を探しただろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":137.87,"end":141.56,"text":"削れて こぼれて 落っこちて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":141.56,"end":161.06,"text":"取り戻せなくなってからじゃ遅いからさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":161.06,"end":164.71,"text":"散々悩んでやっとわかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":164.71,"end":168.74,"text":"人間は一人でいちゃダメだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":168.74,"end":171.82,"text":"平気になんかならなくていいよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":171.82,"end":173.77,"text":"大丈夫じゃないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":173.77,"end":179.01,"text":"それは大丈夫じゃないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":179.01,"end":183.05,"text":"何度 傷つけ 間違って 失敗して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":183.05,"end":187.58,"text":"優しさ蔑